Error [E0388]: `@fn` is retired; write `prep fn`.
  --> tests/ui/prep_fn_at_retired.jet:8:5
    |
  8 |     @fn from_literal(value: Int) -> Cents { Cents{amount: value} }
    |     ^^^
 Why: Build-time blocks, branches, loops and functions carry the word `prep`, the same word Jet uses for every build-time step. The meaning and the checks are unchanged.
 Fix: Replace `@fn` with `prep fn`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0388
